   "metadata": {
    "title": "Manetho's history of Egypt",
    "description": "The Egyptian priest **Manetho** writes the **Aegyptiaca**, a history of Egypt in Greek. It is lost, but excerpts survive, and his division of the kings into thirty dynasties is the one Egyptologists still use.",
    "tags": [
     "writing"
    ],
